        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86463, Cabinet Glendon Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are looking for cabinet hardware that will introduce a since of style and movement to your space, the Glendon Cabinet Knob is just what you need. This stylish, transitional cabinet knob is available in 2 sizes. Choose from an array of beautiful finish colors. The cabinet Glendon Knob comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Glendon Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86463-specifications.pdf?v=1704262414\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Glendon Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86463: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86464: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
